{"id":"659195","name":"虾滑白菜煲","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/659195/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"300g"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"蛋清","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾和白菜。","img":"images/659195/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾去皮，虾头留下。","img":"images/659195/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"虾仁对半切开，取虾线。","img":"images/659195/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾仁剁成虾泥。","img":"images/659195/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打一个鸡蛋清。","img":"images/659195/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入盐，胡椒粉调味，搅打均匀，加一点玉米淀粉，继续搅上劲。","img":"images/659195/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"砂锅烧热，干煸虾头，好多网友都放油，我……没放。","img":"images/659195/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"虾头变红，挤出虾脑。","img":"images/659195/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加热水大火烧开。","img":"images/659195/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撇去浮沫，下入虾滑。","img":"images/659195/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"继续撇去浮沫。","img":"images/659195/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"虾滑定型以后，放入白菜。","img":"images/659195/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"白菜软了以后，就熟了，放一丢丢蚝油和酱油调整即可。","img":"images/659195/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}